solc-output/
# The vendored production bundle is committed deliberately — package.json's
# `postinstall: webpack --mode production` rebuilds dist/ on every install, so
# the droplet's built output cannot be reproduced from source and is copied in
# by fly/Dockerfile instead.
#
# The `*.html` and `dist/` rules above would silently swallow four of its files,
# including gif.html (the page the GIF renderer screenshots) and nft.html (the
# animation_url every token points at). The result would be a repo that clones
# and builds cleanly into an image whose renderer draws a 404.
!vendor/
!vendor/**
